ake a big difference so what was  that moment like that that hug between  you and Tom Brady  uh it was awesome you know he's the  ultimate professional he's the greatest  of all time and it's been an honor to  get to play with him and you know learn  from him on not just being a football  player being a professional being a  father  he's just been you know helping me out  for 10 years now show me the ropes and  you know it's it's pretty cool to have  guys like him around Julian Edelman  congratulations on the MVP  congratulations on the Super Bowl win  great victory I appreciate it guys I  appreciate it
 

